  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Convention on Cluster Munitions - CCM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway&apos;s contributions to the CCM&apos;s annual budgets and voluntary contrubutions to the CCM trust fund. The main objective is capacity building of developing countries&#x2019; capability to comply with the convention, for the protection of civilians from the harm from weapons in armed conflicts.</narrative>
